<view class="organizer-page ab-safe-bottom"><view class="organizer-header"><view><text class="organizer-header__eyebrow">AB CLUB · ORGANIZER</text><text class="organizer-header__title">主理人公开资料</text></view><ab-evidence-label mode="{{runtimeMode}}" /></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="organizer-loading" aria-role="status">正在读取人工审核后的公开投影…</view><view wx:elif="{{hasOrganizer}}" class="organizer-card" aria-role="article" aria-label="主理人 {{organizer.name}}"><view class="organizer-card__mark" aria-hidden="true">AB</view><text class="organizer-card__name">{{organizer.name}}</text><text class="organizer-card__name-en">{{organizer.nameEn}}</text><view class="organizer-card__evidence"><text>{{organizer.reviewLabel}}</text><text>{{organizer.verificationLabel}}</text></view><text class="organizer-card__summary">{{organizer.summary}}</text><view class="organizer-card__cities"><text class="organizer-card__section-title">获批服务城市</text><text wx:for="{{organizer.cities}}" wx:key="*this" class="organizer-card__city">{{item}}</text></view><view class="organizer-card__boundary" aria-role="note">本页只读。前端不提供申请、编辑角色或自行声明 organizer 的字段。</view></view><ab-event-state wx:else kind="{{stateKind}}" title="{{stateTitle}}" description="{{stateDescription}}" detail="{{stateDetail}}" /></view>